// PowerShell Download Cradle
// Detects the in-memory download-and-execute patterns used to stage a payload without writing it to disk, covering both the WebClient and Invoke-WebRequest forms alongside an execution primitive.
// techniques: T1059.001   severity: high
// source: rules/execution/powershell-download-cradle.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
Event
| where ((((NewProcessName endswith "\\powershell.exe" or NewProcessName endswith "\\pwsh.exe")) and ((CommandLine has_any (dynamic(["DownloadString", "DownloadFile", "Invoke-WebRequest", "Net.WebClient", "iwr ", "curl "]))))) and ((CommandLine has_any (dynamic(["IEX", "Invoke-Expression", "iex(", "| iex"])))))
